---
// Verbatim Authentic Content & Media from Khao Sok Riverside Cottages
import PageLayout from '../../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

---

<PageLayout
  title="Cheow Lan Lake"
  description="Cheow Lan Lake Discover more with our Khao Sok FAQs"
  heroImage="/images/khao-sok-hero-cottages.jpg"
  heroTitle="Cheow Lan Lake"
  heroSubtitle="Cheow Lan Lake Expeditions & Floating Bungalows"
  breadcrumbs={[{"label": "Faq Category", "href": "/faq-category/"}, {"label": "Cheow Lan Lake", "href": "/faq-category/cheow-lan-lake/"}]}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <div class="bg-[#faf8f5]/95 border border-[#12281b]/10 rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md">
      
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#12281b]/10 pb-4 mb-8 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-[#163824]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
          <span class="text-[#7a5813]">KSR</span>
          <span class="text-[#12281b]/20">/</span>
          <span>FIELD DISPATCH</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[#7a5813] font-bold">KHAO SOK · THAILAND</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">

        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Are there any luxury floating bungalows on Cheow Lan lake?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Yes — several raft-houses now offer higher-end stays with air-conditioning, private decks, and en-suite bathrooms. However you will need to make special arrangements to book them and you will need to book well in advance. Please contact reservations for more information.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>What’s the best time to visit Cheow Lan Lake?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Cheow Lan Lake is open year-round. The dry season (Dec – Apr) offers clear skies; the rainy season (May – Nov) brings lush scenery and waterfalls.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Can I visit Cheow Lan lake without staying overnight?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Yes — day trips are available from Khao Sok Village and nearby towns.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Is Cheow Lan Lake in Khao Sok National Park?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Yes. The lake lies entirely within the boundaries of Khao Sok National Park, Surat Thani Province.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Can You Hike on Your Own when you visit Cheow Lan Lake?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          No — You cannot hike on your own when you visit Cheow Lan Lake. A variety of wildlife live in the dense rainforest. It can therefore be dangerous for inexperienced visitors. You must have a local guide for all treks, ensuring both safety and ecological protection.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Is It Safe to Swim in Cheow Lan Lake?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Yes — swimming is safe in designated areas. There are no dangerous fish or animals in the lake, and the water is clean and warm. Avoid swallowing the water and always follow local safety advice.
        </p>
      </div>

      
    </div>
  </article>
</PageLayout>
